# The gRPC client variation point attaches to the base plateau: it adds the
# fixed client code (infrastructure/client/core), the consumed contract and
# its generated code, the todo API's adapter and its mock, the service over
# it, and the command that uses it, and changes only these base files: the
# composition root, the command registry and its package, and the dependency,
# build, and readme files.
base library/architecture/python/base-plateau-in-python.skill/examples
change src/todo/main.py
change src/todo/command/handlers.py
change src/todo/command/__init__.py
change pyproject.toml
change Makefile
change README.md
# The todo API's adapter is written per API: the HTTP and the gRPC client
# examples each show their own. The service over it catches only the outcomes
# of infrastructure/client/core/outcomes.py, the same for both.
sample src/todo/infrastructure/client/todo_api/*
